{"seq":3,"slug":"discovery-catalog","title":"数据发现与目录系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-mesh-architecture/architecture/discovery-catalog","wordCount":1501,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据发现与目录系统\">数据发现与目录系统</h1><p>数据目录（Data Catalog）和发现（Discovery）能力是&quot;数据即产品&quot;原则中可发现性特征的技术实现。一个有效的数据发现系统让消费者能够像使用 Google 搜索一样找到可信赖的数据产品，而不需要在 Slack 频道里询问&quot;有没有人知道订单数据在哪里&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据发现的核心问题\">数据发现的核心问题</h2><p>数据消费者在发现数据时面临三个问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>存在性（Existence）</strong>：这类数据是否存在？在哪里？</li>\n<li><strong>可信性（Trustworthiness）</strong>：这个数据集的质量如何？上次更新是什么时候？有没有 owner 负责？</li>\n<li><strong>理解性（Understanding）</strong>：这个字段的语义是什么？如何正确使用？有什么已知的限制？</li>\n</ol>\n<p>传统数据目录主要解决存在性问题，数据网格的数据目录需要全面解决三个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主流开源数据目录对比\">主流开源数据目录对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>数据网格支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>DataHub</strong></td>\n<td>LinkedIn 开源，推/拉式摄取，血缘强</td>\n<td>大型企业，需要程序化注册</td>\n<td>支持 Domain 概念，API 成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Amundsen</strong></td>\n<td>Lyft 开源，搜索体验好，社区活跃</td>\n<td>中型团队，数据分析师为主</td>\n<td>可扩展，无原生 Domain</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OpenMetadata</strong></td>\n<td>功能最全，一体化，发展快</td>\n<td>希望单一工具覆盖全场景</td>\n<td>内置 Data Product 和 Domain 概念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Apache Atlas</strong></td>\n<td>Hadoop 生态，Ranger 集成</td>\n<td>现有 Hadoop 环境</td>\n<td>较重，数据网格适配需定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Google Dataplex</strong></td>\n<td>GCP 原生，自动发现</td>\n<td>GCP 用户</td>\n<td>内置数据网格 Domain 管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>推荐选择</strong>：对于新建数据网格，DataHub 或 OpenMetadata 是最佳选择。DataHub 的推/拉摄取框架和 Python SDK 成熟，程序化集成能力强；OpenMetadata 的 Data Product 概念与数据网格更接近。</p>\n<h2 id=\"datahub-核心架构\">DataHub 核心架构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"DataHub 架构（简化）&#10;&#10;领域数据产品 ──── Metadata Events ──→ Kafka ──→ Metadata Service (GMS)&#10;                                                        │&#10;第三方系统 ──────── REST API ─────────────────────────────│&#10;(Spark, Airflow, dbt)                                   │&#10;                                                        ▼&#10;                                                   Elasticsearch&#10;                                                   (搜索索引)&#10;                                                        │&#10;                                                        ▼&#10;                                                   DataHub UI / GraphQL API&#10;                                                   (消费者发现界面)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>DataHub 架构（简化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>领域数据产品 ──── Metadata Events ──→ Kafka ──→ Metadata Service (GMS)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第三方系统 ──────── REST API ─────────────────────────────│</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(Spark, Airflow, dbt)                                   │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                        ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                   Elasticsearch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                   (搜索索引)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                        │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                        ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                   DataHub UI / GraphQL API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                                   (消费者发现界面)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"datahub-摄取配置\">DataHub 摄取配置</h3><p>数据产品 CI/CD 中配置 DataHub 摄取：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# datahub-ingestion-recipe.yaml&#10;source:&#10;  type: bigquery&#10;  config:&#10;    project_id: &#39;company-dw&#39;&#10;    dataset_pattern:&#10;      allow: [&#39;order_domain.*&#39;, &#39;user_domain.*&#39;]&#10;&#10;    # 自动发现 schema 和 partition 信息&#10;    include_table_lineage: true&#10;    include_view_lineage: true&#10;&#10;    # 统计信息（列级基数、空值率等）&#10;    enable_profiling: true&#10;    profile_pattern:&#10;      allow: [&#39;order_domain.order_events_v2&#39;]&#10;&#10;transformers:&#10;  # 将 BigQuery 数据集映射到 DataHub Domain&#10;  - type: &#39;simple_dataset_ownership&#39;&#10;    config:&#10;      default_ownership_type: &#39;DATAOWNER&#39;&#10;&#10;  - type: &#39;pattern_add_dataset_domain&#39;&#10;    config:&#10;      semantics: &#39;OVERWRITE&#39;&#10;      domain_pattern:&#10;        rules:&#10;          &#39;order_domain.*&#39;: &#39;urn:li:domain:order&#39;&#10;          &#39;user_domain.*&#39;: &#39;urn:li:domain:user&#39;&#10;&#10;sink:&#10;  type: datahub-rest&#10;  config:&#10;    server: &#39;https://datahub.internal:8080&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># datahub-ingestion-recipe.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bigquery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    project_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'company-dw'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    dataset_pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_domain.*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user_domain.*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 自动发现 schema 和 partition 信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    include_table_lineage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    include_view_lineage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 统计信息（列级基数、空值率等）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    enable_profiling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    profile_pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      allow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order_domain.order_events_v2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">transformers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 将 BigQuery 数据集映射到 DataHub Domain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'simple_dataset_ownership'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      default_ownership_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DATAOWNER'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pattern_add_dataset_domain'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      semantics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'OVERWRITE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      domain_pattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          'order_domain.*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'urn:li:domain:order'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          'user_domain.*'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'urn:li:domain:user'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sink</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">datahub-rest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://datahub.internal:8080'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"元数据模型设计\">元数据模型设计</h2><h3 id=\"数据产品元数据层次\">数据产品元数据层次</h3><p>有效的数据目录需要多层次的元数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"技术元数据（自动采集）&#10;├── schema（字段名、类型、可空性）&#10;├── partition 信息&#10;├── 存储位置 URL&#10;├── 行数、文件大小&#10;├── 最后更新时间&#10;└── 血缘（来自哪里，流向哪里）&#10;&#10;业务元数据（人工维护 + 半自动）&#10;├── 中文描述（dataset 级和字段级）&#10;├── 所属 Domain 和 Owner&#10;├── 数据分级（PII、CONFIDENTIAL、PUBLIC）&#10;├── 业务词汇表链接&#10;├── 使用场景说明&#10;└── 已知限制和注意事项&#10;&#10;操作元数据（SLO 和质量状态）&#10;├── 当前质量评分&#10;├── SLO 达成状态&#10;├── 最近 7 天质量趋势&#10;├── 活跃消费者数量&#10;└── 最近一次事件告警\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>技术元数据（自动采集）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── schema（字段名、类型、可空性）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── partition 信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 存储位置 URL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 行数、文件大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 最后更新时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 血缘（来自哪里，流向哪里）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>业务元数据（人工维护 + 半自动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 中文描述（dataset 级和字段级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 所属 Domain 和 Owner</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 数据分级（PII、CONFIDENTIAL、PUBLIC）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 业务词汇表链接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 使用场景说明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 已知限制和注意事项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>操作元数据（SLO 和质量状态）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 当前质量评分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── SLO 达成状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 最近 7 天质量趋势</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── 活跃消费者数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── 最近一次事件告警</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"字段级语义注释\">字段级语义注释</h3><p>字段级注释是数据可理解性的关键，应在数据产品 schema 定义时就填写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;order_status&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;STRING&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;订单当前状态&quot;,&#10;  &quot;businessDescription&quot;: &quot;订单在履约流程中的生命周期节点&quot;,&#10;  &quot;validValues&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;CREATED&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;订单已创建，待支付&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;PAID&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;支付已确认，待仓库拣货&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;PICKED&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;仓库拣货完成，待出库&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;SHIPPED&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;已出库，在途中&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;DELIVERED&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;确认收货&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;value&quot;: &quot;CANCELLED&quot;, &quot;description&quot;: &quot;已取消，含自动取消和用户主动取消&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;glossaryTerms&quot;: [&quot;OrderStatus&quot;],&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: [&quot;order_lifecycle&quot;, &quot;fulfillment&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"STRING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"订单当前状态\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"businessDescription\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"订单在履约流程中的生命周期节点\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"validValues\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CREATED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"订单已创建，待支付\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PAID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"支付已确认，待仓库拣货\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PICKED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-d